<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">
  Welcome to Odinbook, <%= @user.username %>!
</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#131722;">
  Thanks for signing up. Your profile is ready — add a picture, write a bio,
  and start following people to build your feed.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 24px;">
  <a href="<%= edit_profile_url %>"
     style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:999px;background:#3b5bdb;color:#ffffff;font-weight:650;font-size:15px;text-decoration:none;">
    Set up your profile
  </a>
</p>

<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#6a7285;">
  Or paste this into your browser:<br>
  <a href="<%= edit_profile_url %>" style="color:#3b5bdb;"><%= edit_profile_url %></a>
</p>
